    {
      "name": "dsh-plugin-dsh-sync",
      "title": {
        "en": "Device Sync · 设备同步",
        "zh": "设备同步"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Peer-to-peer sync for two DeepSeek Harness machines on the same LAN and account: sessions, workspace, profile/plugins, plugin dependencies, API keys, attachments. Host pushes, sub only receives. Built-in shadow workspace runs a session on the paired machine while you watch and approve locally.",
        "zh": "同一局域网、同一账号下两台 DSH 的点对点同步：会话、工作区、配置与插件、插件依赖、API Key、附件。主机推送、子机只收；内置影子工作区，会话真实运行在配对电脑上，本机查看与审批。"
      },
