      "title": {
        "en": "Casket · Disaster Recovery",
        "zh": "忆匣 / Casket"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Real-time content-addressed snapshots of the whole DSH_HOME with one-click restore, quarantine instead of deletion, refuse-to-restore on missing blocks, an offline recovery console when DSH will not boot, encrypted offsite copies, and a crash black box with an external watchdog.",
        "zh": "实时快照整个 DSH_HOME：内容寻址去重、一键回滚与隔离、缺块拒绝恢复、DSH 起不来也能用外部控制台恢复、异地加密副本、黑匣子心跳与外部看门狗。"
      },
